{
  "id": 2088,
  "name": "magical-star-pick",
  "fling_power": null,
  "fling_effect": null,
  "attributes": [],
  "category": {
    "name": "picnic",
    "url": "/api/v2/item-category/55/"
  },
  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "魔法のステッキ型の　ピック。　お弁当を作った人の　おいしくなあれ　という気持ちこそが　魔法なのかもしれない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "요술봉 모양의 픽. 맛있게 먹어 줬으면 하는 도시락을 만든 사람의 마음이야말로 진정한 요술일지도 모른다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以魔法杖為造型的小籤。製作便當的人想做出美味佳餚的心念說不定才是真正的魔法。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une pique en forme de baguette magique. Peut-être que ce qu’il y a de magique là-dedans, c’est de mettre tout son cœur à préparer un bon repas pour ses amis ?",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Pikser in Form eines Zauberstabs. Vielleicht liegt die wahre Magie in der Hingabe, die in die Zubereitung eines derart verzierten Gerichts gesteckt wurde.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tiene forma de báculo mágico, lo que podría explicar por qué las comidas en las que se ensarta siempre salen buenísimas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Stecchino a forma di bacchetta magica. Forse la vera magia la fa la cura che ci mette chi prepara il panino.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A pick shaped after a magic wand. Perhaps the real magic is the food maker’s wish for a delicious dish.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "魔法のステッキ型の　ピック。　お弁当を作った人の　おいしくなあれ　という気持ちこそが　魔法なのかもしれない。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "魔法棒形的签子。制作便当的人那希望做得好吃的心愿或许就是魔法。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "scarlet-violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/25/"
      },
      "language": {
